   "text": "Role: agents call only the tools in\nallowed_tools. Foundry holds each\nuser's OAuth token per connection.\nThe governed agent asks a human to\napprove place_order. The guardrail\nscreens prompts, completions and tool\noutput.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
