   "text": "Role: the operator holds control-plane roles and the same data app\nroles as Wes and Tara. The kill-switch and allow-list scripts write\nAPIM named values; Reset demo also writes group membership and\nthe operator's roles in Entra.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
