   "text": "Blast radius: the operator can change the kill switch, the allow-list, the\nfront-door limits and their own roles. The Demo Console listens on\n127.0.0.1 only; the jump box has no public IP.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d13_0145",
   "originalText": "Blast radius: the operator can change the kill switch, the allow-list, the\nfront-door limits and their own roles. The Demo Console listens on\n127.0.0.1 only; the jump box has no public IP.",
