   "text": "Role: Azure Policy initiative abw-agent-platform-controls (no keys,\nprivate networking, approved tools and models, guardrails, hygiene)\nand a budget with alerts at 50, 80 and 100 % actual and 100 %\nforecast.",
   "fontSize": 16,
