   "text": "Role: container logs and App Insights feed Log Analytics\n(AbwMcpAudit, AbwGateway, AbwFullChain). Five MCP servers also\nappend JSON lines to a WORM audit blob. Sentinel rules and a\nworkbook sit on top.",
