  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0179",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 370.0,
   "y": 1558.0,
   "width": 529.14,
   "height": 60.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2717540,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 18746660,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The agent shows (none) for the wall, actions or private tools (or 403 on\nvendor) long after the roles were fixed. Foundry keeps the token 60-90 min\nand the tool list about 15-20 min.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The agent shows (none) for the wall, actions or private tools (or 403 on\nvendor) long after the roles were fixed. Foundry keeps the token 60-90 min\nand the tool list about 15-20 min.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0180",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 930.0,
   "y": 1568.0,
   "width": 548.66,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2725459,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 18851389,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The tool list the agent run reports ([tools/list] wall: (none)). A consent link lives\nabout 10 min and must be opened signed in as that persona.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The tool list the agent run reports ([tools/list] wall: (none)). A consent link lives\nabout 10 min and must be opened signed in as that persona.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0181",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1530.0,
   "y": 1558.0,
   "width": 768.3,
   "height": 60.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2733378,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 18956118,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Apply the persona role baseline first. Then delete the connection through ARM, run foundry-connections.ps1\n-Only <name>, consent again and republish with create_agents.py --rai abw-agent-guardrails. A redirect-URI\nmismatch needs foundry-connections.ps1 -Force.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Apply the persona role baseline first. Then delete the connection through ARM, run foundry-connections.ps1\n-Only <name>, consent again and republish with create_agents.py --rai abw-agent-guardrails. A redirect-URI\nmismatch needs foundry-connections.ps1 -Force.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0185",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 370.0,
   "y": 1636.0,
   "width": 509.55,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2765054,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 19375034,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "401 with {error: unauthorized, server, reason} and a WWW-Authenticate\nresource_metadata header.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "401 with {error: unauthorized, server, reason} and a WWW-Authenticate\nresource_metadata header.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0186",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 930.0,
   "y": 1636.0,
   "width": 551.36,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2772973,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 19479763,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The reason in the response body. KQL AbwGateway lists the call as Outcome\nunauthenticated: a 401 never reaches the policy trace.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The reason in the response body. KQL AbwGateway lists the call as Outcome\nunauthenticated: a 401 never reaches the policy trace.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0187",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1530.0,
   "y": 1636.0,
   "width": 774.58,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2780892,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 19584492,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Right after abw-kill or abw-allow the old token no longer matches the gateway: wait about 50 s, request a new\ntoken (abw-gw does), then run abw-kill -Reset and abw-allow -Reset.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Right after abw-kill or abw-allow the old token no longer matches the gateway: wait about 50 s, request a new\ntoken (abw-gw does), then run abw-kill -Reset and abw-allow -Reset.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0191",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 370.0,
   "y": 1704.0,
   "width": 256.99,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
