   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2875920,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 20841240,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Fix what the code names. Federated credentials come from Setup-Entra.ps1 phase 2; consent to the data\nresources comes from phase 1.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Fix what the code names. Federated credentials come from Setup-Entra.ps1 phase 2; consent to the data\nresources comes from phase 1.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0203",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 370.0,
   "y": 1820.0,
   "width": 455.31,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2907596,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 21260156,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The red-team run just completes: the guardrail did not intervene.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The red-team run just completes: the guardrail did not intervene.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0204",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 930.0,
   "y": 1810.0,
   "width": 556.69,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2915515,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 21364885,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Expected: the guardrail is a preview, best-effort control. When it does fire, KQL\nAbwDenials shows Layer 0-agent-guardrail and Sentinel raises ABW-008.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Expected: the guardrail is a preview, best-effort control. When it does fire, KQL\nAbwDenials shows Layer 0-agent-guardrail and Sentinel raises ABW-008.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0205",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1530.0,
   "y": 1810.0,
   "width": 769.23,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2923434,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 21469614,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Ask again, or show the stored blocked trace and the ABW-008 incident. Never present it as deterministic; the\nwall is the control.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Ask again, or show the stored blocked trace and the ABW-008 incident. Never present it as deterministic; the\nwall is the control.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0209",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 370.0,
   "y": 1868.0,
   "width": 511.3,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2955110,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 21888530,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "An Act 6 board says it is no longer in memory, or a watchtower row says\nWaiting.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "An Act 6 board says it is no longer in memory, or a watchtower row says\nWaiting.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0210",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 930.0,
   "y": 1868.0,
   "width": 578.4,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2963029,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 21993259,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Boards live in the console's memory only: a restart, or newer runs, push them out.\nOr the log has not arrived yet. The probe cache lasts 120 s.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Boards live in the console's memory only: a restart, or newer runs, push them out.\nOr the log has not arrived yet. The probe cache lasts 120 s.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0211",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1530.0,
   "y": 1868.0,
   "width": 785.6,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2970948,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 22097988,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Run the scenario again. Press Refresh from logs 15-20 min after the click (Entra's own sign-in log can take that\nlong).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Run the scenario again. Press Refresh from logs 15-20 min after the click (Entra's own sign-in log can take that\nlong).",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0215",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 370.0,
   "y": 1936.0,
   "width": 251.68,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3002624,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 22516904,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "HTTP 429 right after the burst beat.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "HTTP 429 right after the burst beat.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0216",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 930.0,
   "y": 1926.0,
   "width": 517.52,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3010543,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 22621633,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The limit is 120 calls per 60 s per user. KQL AbwGateway lists the call as\nOutcome rate_limited.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The limit is 120 calls per 60 s per user. KQL AbwGateway lists the call as\nOutcome rate_limited.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0217",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1530.0,
   "y": 1936.0,
   "width": 71.14,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3018462,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 22726362,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Wait 60 s.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Wait 60 s.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0221",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 370.0,
   "y": 1984.0,
   "width": 458.06,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3050138,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 23145278,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "An agent beat is refused with 403 token_quota_exceeded or 429\nrate_limited.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "An agent beat is refused with 403 token_quota_exceeded or 429\nrate_limited.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0222",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 930.0,
   "y": 1984.0,
   "width": 555.82,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3058057,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 23250007,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The Agent entry light says not the baseline. A limit lowered by Act 7 beat 7.4 is\nstill in force, or the rate limiter's lock-out (about 2 min) is still counting down.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The Agent entry light says not the baseline. A limit lowered by Act 7 beat 7.4 is\nstill in force, or the rate limiter's lock-out (about 2 min) is still counting down.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0223",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1530.0,
   "y": 1984.0,
   "width": 796.8,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3065976,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 23354736,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Reset demo puts both settings back (APIM named values abw-agent-token-quota and abw-agent-rpm) and waits\nuntil the front door forwards.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Reset demo puts both settings back (APIM named values abw-agent-token-quota and abw-agent-rpm) and waits\nuntil the front door forwards.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0227",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 370.0,
   "y": 2052.0,
   "width": 523.78,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3097652,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 23773652,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "abw-chain returns 0 rows or only the gateway row. A Sentinel incident has\nnot appeared.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "abw-chain returns 0 rows or only the gateway row. A Sentinel incident has\nnot appeared.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0228",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 930.0,
   "y": 2042.0,
   "width": 574.46,
   "height": 60.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3105571,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 23878381,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Ingestion lag of 5-10 min (the MCP-server row of a denial can take longer), or the\nwrong request id. Sentinel incidents appear up to about 8 min after the event\n(about 13 for ABW-007).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Ingestion lag of 5-10 min (the MCP-server row of a denial can take longer), or the\nwrong request id. Sentinel incidents appear up to about 8 min after the event\n(about 13 for ABW-007).",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0229",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1530.0,
   "y": 2062.0,
   "width": 692.74,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3113490,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 23983110,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Wait, then run it again. For abw-chain -Allowed, first run abw-ask op falcon and wait about 10 min.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Wait, then run it again. For abw-chain -Allowed, first run abw-ask op falcon and wait about 10 min.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0233",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 370.0,
   "y": 2130.0,
   "width": 337.5,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3145166,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 24402026,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Connect > Bastion in the portal will not connect.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Connect > Bastion in the portal will not connect.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0234",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 930.0,
   "y": 2120.0,
   "width": 578.94,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3153085,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 24506755,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The VM stops itself at 03:00 Central, so it may be deallocated. Or another Bastion\nDeveloper session is open (one at a time).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The VM stops itself at 03:00 Central, so it may be deallocated. Or another Bastion\nDeveloper session is open (one at a time).",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0235",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1530.0,
   "y": 2130.0,
   "width": 779.9,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3161004,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 24611484,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Run Start-JumpBox.bat (about 1 min), close the other session and retry. jumpbox.ps1 -Status shows the state.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Run Start-JumpBox.bat (about 1 min), close the other session and retry. jumpbox.ps1 -Status shows the state.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0237",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 76.0,
   "y": 2225.0,
   "width": 127.84,
   "height": 25.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp13_002"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3176842,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 24820942,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What to notice",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "What to notice",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0238",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 76.0,
   "y": 2258.0,
   "width": 824.35,
   "height": 157.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp13_002"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3184761,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 24925671,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- A failure at one wall does not open the next: each wall decides again on its own. The data plane\n  checks the user's own token, so a compromised server reaches no more than the person could, apart\n  from what its UAMI holds.\n- The soft spots are time and preview effects: the guardrail, the 45-90 s kill switch, token lifetime, log lag\n  and the unlocked audit store. The private MCP server sits outside the gateway kill switch and rate\n  limit.\n- Read the table from the symptom. Every row names the log or the portal page that explains it.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "- A failure at one wall does not open the next: each wall decides again on its own. The data plane\n  checks the user's own token, so a compromised server reaches no more than the person could, apart\n  from what its UAMI holds.\n- The soft spots are time and preview effects: the guardrail, the 45-90 s kill switch, token lifetime, log lag\n  and the unlocked audit store. The private MCP server sits outside the gateway kill switch and rate\n  limit.\n- Read the table from the symptom. Every row names the log or the portal page that explains it.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0240",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 966.0,
   "y": 2225.0,
   "width": 420.2,
   "height": 25.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp13_003"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3200599,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 25135129,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The boundaries, in order (numbers on the path)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The boundaries, in order (numbers on the path)",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0241",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 966.0,
   "y": 2258.0,
   "width": 622.88,
   "height": 60.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp13_003"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3208518,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 25239858,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Callers hold Entra tokens: T1 for Foundry, T2a for an MCP API.\n2. Entra signs them and decides the roles inside.\n3. Foundry (Wall 0) offers only allowed_tools, holds the user's T2b and screens the turn.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. Callers hold Entra tokens: T1 for Foundry, T2a for an MCP API.\n2. Entra signs them and decides the roles inside.\n3. Foundry (Wall 0) offers only allowed_tools, holds the user's T2b and screens the turn.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d13_0242",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1659.0,
   "y": 2258.0,
   "width": 625.06,
   "height": 80.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp13_003"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3216437,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 25344587,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "4. APIM (Wall 1) validates T2a or T2b, the role, the client and the rate.\n5. The MCP server (Wall 2) re-verifies it and swaps it (OBO, with its T3 assertion) for the\n    user's T4a/b/c.\n6. The data plane (Wall 3) checks its own roles on T4a/b/c.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "4. APIM (Wall 1) validates T2a or T2b, the role, the client and the rate.\n5. The MCP server (Wall 2) re-verifies it and swaps it (OBO, with its T3 assertion) for the\n    user's T4a/b/c.\n6. The data plane (Wall 3) checks its own roles on T4a/b/c.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
